  "Preserving the physical connection in a hyper-digital world.": "Preserving the physical connection in a hyper-digital world.",
  "Founded in the historic workshops of Bath, England, and expanded with curators in Riyadh and Tokyo, The Craft Gift began with a singular, stubborn premise: as the world moves further behind smooth glowing screens, our relationships still crave weight, scent, grain, and touch.": "Founded in the historic workshops of Bath, England, and expanded with curators in Riyadh and Tokyo, The Craft Gift began with a singular, stubborn premise: as the world moves further behind smooth glowing screens, our relationships still crave weight, scent, grain, and touch.",
  "Our Materials Philosophy": "Our Materials Philosophy",
  "We source exclusively from generational craftsmen who refuse compromises. Full-grain vegetable tanned leather, hand-thrown high-silica glass, premium slow-dried walnut woods, and organic wild cotton fibers. These are materials that carry weight, accumulate a beautiful patina over time, and hold stories.": "We source exclusively from generational craftsmen who refuse compromises. Full-grain vegetable tanned leather, hand-thrown high-silica glass, premium slow-dried walnut woods, and organic wild cotton fibers. These are materials that carry weight, accumulate a beautiful patina over time, and hold stories.",
