  "Unlike conventional shops that use excessive plastic wrapping, we protect your precious gifts with natural, renewable elements: clean pine shavings, handmade mulberry paper, and dried wildflowers.": "Unlike conventional shops that use excessive plastic wrapping, we protect your precious gifts with natural, renewable elements: clean pine shavings, handmade mulberry paper, and dried wildflowers.",
  "\"A gift is not just a transaction, but a meaningful connection between people.\" — Lin, Founder": "\"A gift is not just a transaction, but a meaningful connection between people.\" — Lin, Founder",
